### Authenticate
POST https://warp-scores.eu.auth0.com/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "{{clientId}}",
  "client_secret": "{{clientSecret}}",
  "audience": "warp-scores-backend",
  "grant_type":"client_credentials"
}
> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.access_token);
%}


### Status
GET {{backendBaseUrl}}/status
Accept: application/json

### Lookup
POST {{backendBaseUrl}}/lookup
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "league_name": "DBBL  BB3"
}

### Relaod matches
GET {{backendBaseUrl}}/matches/reload


### League
GET {{backendBaseUrl}}/leagues/94dd6ae4-83fa-11ee-b910-02000090a64f
Accept: application/json

### Image
GET {{backendBaseUrl}}/img/logo/Logo_Community_Supported_Competitions

Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "league_name": "DBBL  BB3"
}

